────────────────────
+ do get key-scope KeyScopeNode?

. cursor = key-scope-parent
while cursor
    . node = cursor
    =? node if node.is-key-scope
    cursor = node.key-scope-parent
= null

────────────────────
+ do set-binding-key
    - next KeyCombo

────────────────────
